      DESCRIBE
MATRIX -- LINEAR ALGEBRA, MOSTLY OVER DOMINO.

   ID N          THE N BY N IDENTITY.
   DET M         THE DETERMINANT, BY ELIMINATION.
   INV M         THE INVERSE: DOMINO.
   A SOLVE B     X WITH A+.×X EQUAL TO B: DOMINO.
   TRACE M       THE SUM OF THE DIAGONAL.
   M MPOW N      M TO THE POWER N BY MATRIX PRODUCT.
   NORM V        THE EUCLIDEAN LENGTH OF A VECTOR, OR OF ALL
                 THE ELEMENTS OF A MATRIX.
   ISSYM M       1 IF M IS SQUARE AND EQUAL TO ITS TRANSPOSE.
   GRAM M        THE COLUMNS OF M MADE ORTHONORMAL.

